            "text": "VOL → SOP — Marching Cubes Iso-Surface Extraction\n\nNoiseVOL generates an animated 3D density field.\nMarchingCubesVOL extracts the iso-surface at threshold=0.5\nas a GNGeoData mesh (SOP output).\n\nSmooth normals uses gradient interpolation for cleaner shading.\nLower threshold → more volume visible, higher → less.\nThe SOP output can be wired into GeometryCOMP for 3D rendering.",
